menu "Locker MQTT transport"

    # Production builds leave this off; sdkconfig.dev turns it on (ADR-0071).
    config LC_ALLOW_PLAINTEXT_MQTT
        bool "Allow plain mqtt:// brokers (development and test only)"
        default n
        help
            Accepts an unencrypted mqtt:// broker URL at commissioning and
            connects to it without TLS. Credentials and commands then cross
            the network in clear text. Never enable this in a release build.
            mqtts:// is verified either way.

endmenu
